rprises. \ud83e\udd2f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Online multiplayer catnip mowing with friends or strangers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Chill original music to soundtrack your feline journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Unlockable furr [eventually hats, collars, shoes, and other mysterious broken upgrades too]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Strange, buggy ragdoll low-gravity kitty controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Relaxing yet strangely addictive gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 A world where cats rule, catnip never runs out, and oddities are a feature, not a bug</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/5254f422a01cef8acd68d72de34ee5e8.poster.avif?t=1749851264\" width=320 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/5254f422a01cef8acd68d72de34ee5e8.webm?t=1749851264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/5254f422a01cef8acd68d72de34ee5e8.mp4?t=1749851264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><i>Mow together. Gather together. Stay weird together.</i></strong></p>",
